				<title>SCP-5962</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5962</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP- 5962
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5962 is to be contended at a standard foundation containment locker at site-██ .&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access to SCP-5962 is to be limited to personal to level 3 or higher clearance personal. All ascend to SCP-5962 must have shown to have not murdered or had any record believed to make them to the cause of death for any D-class or civilian deaths&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5962 is a Cassette tape stuck inside a Sony WM-2 Walkmen produced in 1981. The Walkmen has 2 Labels from a label maker on both the front and back of the device. These labels are labeled “play me” on both the front and backsides of the device and have shown to be unable to be removed.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5962 also has shown to be unable to be damage through any means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5962 when played wall warring headphones, will Admit a musically induced trance that well causes the subject to seemingly trance for the entirety of 3 minutes and 42 second’s, in which the subject will be considered in a Hallucinogenics state, and can not be distributed for the entirety of 3 minutes 42 seconds listed before. After which, subjects well awaken and act as if they had just awakened from a nap. Subjects well awaken in a dark void along with all items on them, and either an instance of SCP-5962-1 or SCP-5962-2 for 3 minutes and 42 seconds. Subjects have reported seeing both dead loved ones they had a strong affection or loved ones who had strong affection towards them before death, These Instances are labeled SCP-5962-1. The subject will then speak with SCP-5962-1 until the end of the designated 3 minutes and 42 seconds, and reawaken. However, it’s also been reported that people who the subject have violently terminated, or have been previously been hostile to the subject can appear as well. These instances are labeled SCP-5962-2, and we’ll try and terminate the subject in the dream state. It is believed that if SCP-5962-2 is Successful, the subject we’ll still awaken, however, can be considered possessed by SCP-5962-2 after awakening. In which events, SCP-5962-2 we’ll have no memories of the events and will have all the memories right at the death of the victim/enemy in which case, the subject can be considered terminated. In which case they were to be put into foundation security, and then will be put through heavy psychological analysis to make sure they are not the original subject, and to see whether or not they a dangerous. If consider dangerous, they will be kept in foundation custody, if not, they will be allowed to leave foundation custody and well be given a new life by the foundation, or can request to join the foundation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum-1: all researchers assigned to SCP-5962 must have shown to not have been the cause of death to previous D-class personally. See log 5962-3 and log 5962-7&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addendum-2: D-class who have murdered more than 4 victims or anyone who was in any mass murder incident is not to be allowed to use SCP-5962 as it can result in causing a repeat of incident 5962-7. See log 5962-7&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Log-1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-6732421&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Gender:&lt;/strong&gt; male&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Crime:&lt;/strong&gt; Attempted murder of his brother&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Occupation:&lt;/strong&gt; D-class&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; making D-6732421 listening to the headphones of SCP-5962 to induce a response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;result:&lt;/strong&gt; D-6732421 awake after the designated 3 minutes and 42 seconds and begin crying and later stated he had met with his biological mother, who had passed away 3 years before his crime, and had a conversation about his way he tried to murder his brother and stating her disapproval.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Log-2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-5643212&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Gender:&lt;/strong&gt; Male&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Crime:&lt;/strong&gt; Murder of random civilian&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Occupation:&lt;/strong&gt; D-class&lt;br /&gt;
Procedure: making D-5643212 listening to the headphones of SCP-5962 to induce a response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; D-5643212 awake after the designated 3 minutes and 42 seconds and was shown to be in heavy distress, as he later stated, he claimed to have seen the person he had attempted to murder and was immediately assaulted by the individual, who give chase to D-5643212, until the designated 3 minutes and 42 seconds were up, in which the subject awaken normally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Log-3&lt;/strong&gt;(mark incident)&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher Dr-██████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gender:&lt;/strong&gt; Male&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Crime:&lt;/strong&gt; none&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Occupation:&lt;/strong&gt; foundation researcher of 5 years&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; wearing SCP-5962 and wall holding a stopwatch, to see how long the subject area in the void.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; awake looking around confused, and was quickly discovered to be pervious D-class ██████ subject from older foundation records, and foundation personal immediately subdued D-class ██████. current research on restoring DR.██████ is ongoing&lt;br /&gt;
Log-4&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-239853&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Gender:&lt;/strong&gt; Female&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Crime:&lt;/strong&gt; Attempted murder&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;occupation:&lt;/strong&gt; D-class&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; D-239853 was given a stopwatch and told to activate the watch as soon as she entered SCP-5962 Dream state, and was asked to Periodically look at the time of the watch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; D-239853 awake from SCP- in a normal state, claiming to have met an older EX lover(who well be referred as and an incidence of SCP-1), who foundation agents later discovered had passed away 1 year before D-239853. SCP-1 was reported by the subject to be &amp;quot;happy to see her, even after all she has done&amp;quot; telling her wall she has gone to a bad place, he still loves her. D-239853 also reported that she had looked at the watch 7 times in total, confirming the foundation Hypothesis that they are in the void as long as the song is.&lt;br /&gt;
Log-5&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-562532&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Gender:&lt;/strong&gt; Male&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Crime:&lt;/strong&gt; Mariticide of wife&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Occupation:&lt;/strong&gt; D-class&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; making D-562532 listening to the headphones of SCP-5962 to induce a response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; awake in complete confuse, and reportable screams as soon D-562532( who had most likely lost to an incidence of SCP-2) looks at his arms. it was quickly discovered to be D-562532, dead wife(who now be referred to as . after going through psychological analysis and confirming to have no anomalies effects, was allowed to leave foundation custody, and currently receiving foundation support in starting a new life.&lt;br /&gt;
Log-6&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-376843&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Gender:&lt;/strong&gt; Female&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Crime:&lt;/strong&gt; the murder of 4 individuals&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Occupation:&lt;/strong&gt; D-class&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; making D-376843 listening to the headphones of SCP-5962 to induce a response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; subject awake in a high state of distress, and immediately throw SCP- across the testing room. When asked, D-376843 stated that all of her previous victims had attempted to assault D-376843, and reportedly ran from all incidents of SCP-2 the entire duration of the experiment. D-376843 also reported having a “head-splitting headache”&lt;br /&gt;
Log-7 (mark incident)&lt;br /&gt;
Subject: D-676436&lt;br /&gt;
Gender: Male&lt;br /&gt;
Crime: (Redacted)&lt;br /&gt;
Occupation: D-class&lt;br /&gt;
Procedure: making D-676436 listening to the headphones of SCP-5962 to induce a response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; D-676436 within 5 seconds after putting on Scp-5962, D-676436 awake, and attempted self-termination via running towards a wall, and slamming his head againsted it. Before any foundation security could be sent in, D-676436 reportable let out a high pitched scream, before his head exploded, and the site- experienced a complete on-site blackout. After which, Muitly contaminates braches were reported in the site and were later contained. After which, 05 counsel made all experimentation of requiring that all staff and subjects have never murdered an individual or be seen as the perpetrator of there death&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jimmtey&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4182410&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608237141&quot; alt=&quot;jimmtey&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4182410)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jimmtey&quot;  &gt;jimmtey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
