&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;cellstylz2&quot; colspan=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Dr. Wall used her arms, palms, and fingers to simulate the approximate SCP-5338-&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:130%;&quot;&gt;א&lt;/span&gt; sequence for indoor takeoff. As a safety precaution, all movements were performed at 1/3750th normal gesture speed.&lt;/td&gt;
