&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be moving SCP-5057 to general humanoid containment within the week. We apologize for the mix-up and will endeavor to make sure this does not happen in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hermes Pratt&lt;br /&gt;
Site-55 Containment Team&lt;br /&gt;
Secure, Contain, Protect&lt;/p&gt;
